        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our globalization efforts, we are expanding our coverage of local customers in the overseas markets by providing a wider range of services in retail and corporate banking, and to that end, we have increasingly established subsidiaries in lieu of branches in select markets and in 2011 merged two of our banking subsidiaries in Vietnam in order to enhance our presence in the region and enable greater flexibility in our service offerings in these markets.",
        "start_character": 96576,
        "end_character": 97042
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-168235",
