        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-168235",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-22",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In accordance with accounting requirements under IFRS 9, “Financial Instruments,” which has replaced IAS 39, “Financial Instruments: Recognition and Measurement” since January 1, 2018, we have implemented internal processes which include a number of key controls designed to ensure that fair value is measured appropriately, particularly where a fair value model is internally developed and used to price a significant product.",
